e that official trade figures don’t include the U.S.’ largest “exports” to the world, which is intangible brand/IP/tech that flows via MNCs and aren’t captured in cross-border trade data because the physical products are often produced abroad.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/GlennLuk/status/1908163132347875595">https://x.com/GlennLuk/status/1908163132347875595</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/sunday-assorted-links-511.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=sunday-assorted-links-511">Sunday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/GlennLuk/status/1908163132347875595</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/GlennLuk/status/1908163132347875595</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Apr 2025 16:15:34 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Michael P. Gibson]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1321252236836524033/_hqqkRbv_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Michael P Gibson (@William_Blake) on X</p><p>If we really want Russia to bleed, you know what we should do? Impose free trade on them. Surely they will wince and holler once free trade makes them worse off. Free trade will hollow out their middle class! Ukraine will have the Donbas again in no time</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/william_blake/status/1908488365168558511?s=46">https://x.com/william_blake/status/1908488365168558511?s=46</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/sunday-assorted-links-511.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=sunday-assorted-links-511">Sunday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/william_blake/status/1908488365168558511?s=46</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/william_blake/status/1908488365168558511?s=46</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Apr 2025 16:15:34 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Consumer staples were hit hardest by the stock market decline]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.tw